  "notes": "SIMILAR WORDS:\n- {疲|つか}れ: tiredness — everyday, casual term\n- {疲労|ひろう}: fatigue — more formal/technical, used in writing and medical contexts\n\nUSAGE:\nAlso functions as a する verb: {疲労|ひろう}する (to become fatigued). In technical contexts, {金属|きんぞく}{疲労|ひろう} (metal fatigue) refers to the weakening of materials under repeated stress.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {疲労|ひろう}が{溜|た}まる: fatigue builds up\n- {疲労|ひろう}を{感|かん}じる: feel fatigue\n- {疲労|ひろう}{回復|かいふく}: fatigue recovery\n- {慢性|まんせい}{疲労|ひろう}: chronic fatigue\n- {疲労|ひろう}{骨折|こっせつ}: stress fracture",
